    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<h2>Level 14 — <strong>Terror Charge</strong></h2><p>Fear trails behind you.</p><h3>Mechanical Effects</h3><p>While at <strong>Burn 3+</strong>:</p><ul><li><p>Creatures you hit must make a defense check or become <strong>Shaken of you</strong></p></li><li><p>Shaken creatures have:</p><ul><li><p>roll 3d10 keep lowest 2 on reaction strikes against you</p></li><li><p>Reduced movement when moving away from you</p></li></ul></li></ul><p>At <strong>Burn 4+</strong>:</p><ul><li><p>Nearby enemies (GM-defined radius) must make a defense check or hesitate (lose reactions)</p></li></ul><p>They are not afraid of dying.<br />They are afraid of watching you not stop.</p>",
